    ["　　我站在“黑王座号”的船头，张开双臂，对格林和爱德华兹他们说：“想要我的财宝吗？那就到迷雾海的尽头来寻找吧，我将所有的财宝都藏在了这里！”\n　　他们完全不懂我的幽默，竟然问我是不是真的有额外的财宝，真是无趣啊，你们这样是做不了我的天启四骑士的！"] = "I stood at the bow of the \"Black Throne,\" spread my arms, and said to Green, Edwards, and the others, \"Do you want my treasure? Then go find it at the end of the Fog Sea; I have hidden all my treasure there!\" \n They completely failed to understand my humor and actually asked if I really had extra treasure. How boring; you guys can't be my Four Horsemen of the Apocalypse like this!",
